units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
lattice bcc 3.3
region target block 0 20 0 20 0 40
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 41.5 61.5
region whole union 2 target projectile
create_box 1 whole
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region projectile
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
mass 1 92.906
velocity all create 300 87287 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
group projectile region projectile
velocity projectile set 0 0 2000 sum yes units box
fix 1 all nve
fix 2 all temp/rescale 1 300 300 0.01 1 region target
timestep 0.001
run 100000
unfix 2
run 100000
